  "$comment": "Expected piece roster. This file \u2014 not the filesystem \u2014 is the source of truth for which pieces SHOULD exist; the build diffs it against src/ to produce each manifest's missing[] list. Declaring a piece before the artwork exists is the correct way to record a known gap. Set \"individual\": true on a family to also emit one file per piece alongside the sheet \u2014 for families like cards, where you show one face at a time and loading the whole sheet to do it would be wasteful. Default (omitted) is atlas-only: both Pixi and DOM read the single sheet.",
