      "$note": "No sourceSize: this family is deliberately mixed-resolution. The stones are 256×256 masters, the shadow 128, markers 88, territory marks 84, hoshi 48, and grid-line is a 74×4 strip tiled along each board line. Every piece is drawn to a size that suits its job and is scaled at render time, so declaring one ratio for the family would be a lie the build would enforce. The three capture puffs are NOT here — they are byte-identical to chess's and live in the shared `fx` family.",
